ahci-mv-dkms (1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.  Private AHCI interrupt handler for Marvell 88SE61xx that
    clears HOST_IRQ_STAT before servicing the ports, fixing lost command
    completions on the 88SE6121 (kernel bug 216094).

